	(text "Notes on my(Benito) pin choice for the new STM\n- Chosen pins to match functions/capabilities and \n  physical location so I'm fairly sure everything\n  works and this also makes routing easier\n- For TC_2, neither of PA4 or PA5 were chosen, as\n  I'm not sure what voltage the thermocouples output\n  but those pins can't tolerate 5V, so I chose the \n  next nearest free pin that took 5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 166.878 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2d92bdf9-f6fd-489a-86d0-fa8a75b2b6bc")
	)
